                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR VORHERSAGE DER FAHRTRAJEKTORIE EINES FAHRZEUGS, ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG UND SPEICHERMEDIUM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE PRÉDICTION DE TRAJECTOIRE DE CONDUITE DE VÉHICULE, DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE ET SUPPORT D'INFORMATIONS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">VEHICLE DRIVING TRAJECTORY PREDICTION METHOD AND APPARATUS, ELECTRONIC DEVICE, AND STORAGE MEDIUM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments of the present disclosure provide a vehicle driving trajectory prediction method and apparatus, an electronic device, and a storage medium. The method includes: determining, based on a surround-view image sequence acquired by a vehicle within a first preset time period prior to a current time point, a BEV feature map sequence of an environment in which the vehicle is located; predicting, based on the BEV feature map sequence, dynamic obstacles within a second preset time period subsequent to the current time point to obtain a dynamic obstacle occupancy map sequence; determining, based on the BEV feature map sequence, a drivable area occupancy map and a static environment feature of the vehicle at the current time point; and predicting a driving trajectory of the vehicle based on the dynamic obstacle occupancy map sequence, the drivable area occupancy map, and the static environment feature.</p>
            </abstract>
